vidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:60:    # feedback file names the prior stop's class in prose, and that text\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:80:    # provenance, before the structural check in derive_stop is reached.\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:88:    # check_auth) as an environment/executor stop that never happened.\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:107:# at write time, so a filed issue's own summary of it (file-stops'\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:128:    both from the adapter's own report line (derive_stop's report_class)\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:138:def derive_stop(status: str, *, refusal: str | None = None, halted: dict[str, Any] | None = None,\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:141:    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"The stop field for a build or verify record: None for status \\\\\\\"pass\\\\\\\",\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:214:def gate_stop(refusal: str | None) -> Stop:\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:215:    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"The stop for a refused spec-gate record: class \\\\\\\"gate\\\\\\\", provenance\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:217:    derive_stop's generic claims-boundary/spec fallback issue #133\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:221:    a spec record still carries no stop field of its own; this is\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:222:    synthesized wherever a refused one is read (item_stops,\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:223:    cmd_file_stops, proof_no_stop_lacks_cause), never persisted.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:227:# --- stops: every non-pass record by class, provenance, and answerer\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:230:def item_stops(root: Path, m: dict[str, Any], item_id: str) -> dict[str, Any]:\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:234:    rather than a stop field spec-gate records never carry (gate_stop\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:236:    record_version -- a record too old to carry stop at all still gets\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:241:    number -- the product's own answer, which wins over whatever the stop\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:242:    itself says, since a counseled stop was already read once; failing\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:246:    -- no-cause, unclassed, or no stop at all -- is \\\\\\\"none\\\\\\\": nobody has\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:250:    by_class = {c: 0 for c in stop_class_enum()}\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:252:    before_stop_was_recorded = 0\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:255:    def add_row(stage: str, n: int, stop: Stop | None) -> None:\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:256:        nonlocal before_stop_was_recorded\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:264:        elif stop and stop.get(\\\\\\\"class\\\\\\\") == \\\\\\\"question\\\\\\\":\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:266:        elif stop and stop.get(\\\\\\\"class\\\\\\\") in GUARDED_STOP_CLASSES:\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:271:        if stop:\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:272:            cls, provenance, detail = (stop.get(\\\\\\\"class\\\\\\\"), stop.get(\\\\\\\"provenance\\\\\\\"),\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:273:                                      stop.get(\\\\\\\"detail\\\\\\\"))\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:277:            cls, provenance, detail = \\\\\\\"before stop was recorded\\\\\\\", None, None\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/stops.py:278:            before_stop_was_recorded += 1\\\\n/Users/davidbean/Projects/attest/attavo/sto